# Rebuild yourself

After changing kernel, apps, host tools that affect the guest, or anything the user needs to run next — **rebuild and stage artifacts yourself**. Do not leave `argon build` / `mkaxe` / copy-into-share as “you should run…”.

Typical:

- Firmware: `argon build` (or `argon check` when tests are warranted)
- Apps: `python tools/mkaxe.py …` per app README; copy `.AXE` into the active HostFS/share dir if that is how we run (e.g. `build\sms_share\SMS.AXE`)
- Report what you rebuilt and any command that failed

Only skip a rebuild when the change is docs-only or the user explicitly says not to build.
